WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,100 --> 00:00:03,380
Chen Chen, what's going on?

2
00:00:03,900 --> 00:00:04,900
The above requires team formation

3
00:00:05,180 --> 00:00:09,140
When Qi Xuan's family came in, I took them in. It was pretty good.

4
00:00:09,580 --> 00:00:10,940
Don't push yourself too hard

5
00:00:11,100 --> 00:00:12,980
We are not waste Wenwen either

6
00:00:13,380 --> 00:00:16,670
Why are you the captain of Qi Xuan?

7
00:00:18,380 --> 00:00:21,420
What does it mean that so many of us are pleasing to the eye?

8
00:00:23,290 --> 00:00:28,520
I just find him pleasing to the eye, so

9
00:00:28,880 --> 00:00:33,350
He doesn’t like me, Uncle Yan Wenchen

10
00:00:33,550 --> 00:00:34,550
Shall we have dinner together tonight?

11
00:00:34,870 --> 00:00:36,070
A new hot pot restaurant opened nearby

12
00:00:36,230 --> 00:00:42,270
Jiaojiao and I are going to try it. Thank you.

13
00:00:42,670 --> 00:00:46,030
But we have an appointment in the evening. Let me treat you another day.

14
00:00:46,150 --> 00:00:47,310
Let's eat and sing together

15
00:00:48,150 --> 00:00:49,590
Why don't you invite your friends?

16
00:00:49,870 --> 00:00:50,910
It’s more lively when there are more people
